sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant T as Trader / risk / admin
    participant S as Server
    participant K as Kill switch (account or firm)
    participant O as OrderManager
    participant A as Algo engine
    participant B as Broker
    T->>S: STOP (Ctrl+Shift+K → reason → confirm)
    S->>K: engage FIRST (nothing new can slip in)
    K->>A: stop every algo ("trading stopped: reason")
    S->>O: cancel every working order
    O->>B: cancels (they always pass the gate)
    B-->>O: CANCELLED …
    S-->>T: stopped · any cancel that failed is listed, to act on
    Note over S: band TRADING STOPPED on every screen<br/>new orders and modifies refused · positions kept
    T->>S: resume (owner, risk or admin)
    S->>K: reset → trading allowed again
